        {
          "question": "e-6172",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "We are given the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}9x+3y+(-6)z=8 \\\\ (-6)x+4y+2z=3 \\\\ 5x+(-5)y+(-15)z=10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059591/assets/00a69fe1d48b41e376971f3669ae51668733d36dfda18c0f9cc736d5d071a441.png)\n\nNow, to construct $D_x$, we replace the first column of the coefficient matrix by the right-hand side column of the given system:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059591/assets/14e850c9af7c0b2fdd1e36299667b2cbe91c84e8bb90030b729ee23b296ad984.png)",
