          "question": "e-4577",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Let $\\langle x,y,z \\rangle$ be the solution of the system of equations below. Find $z.$\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-y+3z=-1 \\\\ 4x-2z=1 \\\\ 3x+y-z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$",
