          "question": "e-4579",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Let $\\langle x,y,z \\rangle$ be the solution of the system of equations below. Given that $x = 2,$ find the value of $k.$\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-z=-1 \\\\ kx+3y-2z=1 \\\\ 3x-y+2z=3\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059591/example-4579.json",
          "file_sha256": "ea0bad510dc4dff86485f9480acabda17cb593eeb1e0b65e06a2da7233011cd4"
